      "content": "For the most significant \"bang for your buck\" in terms of social impact, you should prioritize zip codes facing the greatest need. Zip Code 90211 presents the most urgent need due to its high crime rate, lower median income, and high percentage of youth. Zip Code 90212 also warrants consideration because it has moderate crime and a mix of income challenges and younger families requiring support. Finally, Zip Code 90213 offers a good balance with a low crime rate and a substantial population that could benefit from stability improvements.",
